      "body": "The official Figma plugin installs alongside Rig in both orders for Claude and Codex, updates from pinned upstream bundle 2.2.108 to 2.2.111, and uninstalls while preserving the tested Rig edits and deletion. A separate synthetic design/spec/task/code chain passes 13 browser checks at desktop/mobile sizes; independent review inspected all four screenshot images.\n\nVerdict: conditional ADAPT for optional native installation and connection diagnosis. The live MCP probe returns 401; actual design retrieval and Claude-to-Codex sessions remain unverified. No repository-level bundle license was found, so redistribution is not recommended without qualification. A client bundle pin does not pin the hosted backend.\n\nEvidence: 58 passed properties, 0 failed, 8 unverified. Independent validator checks 244 command records, 90 snapshots, hashes and counts. Successful Ubuntu run 34831651581. No credentials, real Figma data, production changes or root Rig payload.\n",
